Consider the following C function.
<pre><code class="c">int fun1 (int n) { 
     int i, j, k, p, q = 0; 
     for (i = 1; i &lt; n; ++i) 
     {
        p = 0; 
       for (j = n; j &gt; 1; j = j/2) 
           ++p;  
       for (k = 1; k &lt; p; k = k * 2) 
           ++q;
     } 
     return q;
}</code></pre>
Which one of the following most closely approximates the return value of the function <b>fun1</b>?

